  "prompt": "Return every sale as sale_id, owner_id. Match ownership by customer_id and sold_at within [valid_from, valid_to); NULL valid_to means open-ended. Intervals for a customer do not overlap, valid_from is known, and sale_id is unique. NULL sale timestamps or customer keys and gaps in ownership yield NULL owner_id. Never replace historical ownership with current ownership.",
  "context": "Sales operations needs attribution as of the sale, after account ownership changed. The source contract guarantees nonoverlapping ownership intervals.",
